  "description": "Lee Min-ha, who left her rural hometown determined to make a living in Seoul no matter what, is forced to return home due to skyrocketing living costs and the job shortage. Fearing she might run into familiar faces, she takes up a somewhat strange and erotic part-time job at a 'grocery store' far from her home, introduced to her by her friend Ye-jin...\n\n[Original Webtoon](https://www.lezhin.com/ko/comic/behind_the_hole)",
